WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.846
"We're going to a fancy restaurant," said Mom.

2
00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:21.482
"I want everyone to look nice."

3
00:00:21.483 --> 00:00:28.569
Emmy put on a pretty dress.

4
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.756
The dress was white with pink flowers.

5
00:00:31.757 --> 00:00:39.274
She put on her best shoes.

6
00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:45.068
Harry put on his favorite sweater.

7
00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:51.725
Oliver put on a nice shirt and pants.

8
00:00:51.726 --> 00:00:58.202
Then he put his favorite toy car in his pocket.

9
00:00:58.203 --> 00:01:02.345
The kids were ready.

10
00:01:02.346 --> 00:01:13.623
But Mom and Dad were not ready.

11
00:01:13.624 --> 00:01:18.633
The kids waited.

12
00:01:18.634 --> 00:01:25.570
Soon Dad was ready, but Mom was not.

13
00:01:25.571 --> 00:01:28.444
"Can we go outside?" asked Emmy.

14
00:01:28.445 --> 00:01:31.193
"Sure," said Dad.

15
00:01:31.194 --> 00:01:40.620
"But don't get dirty."

16
00:01:40.621 --> 00:01:44.598
Emmy, Harry, and Oliver went outside.

17
00:01:44.599 --> 00:01:48.057
Puddles were everywhere.

18
00:01:48.058 --> 00:01:53.101
"Puddles!" said Oliver.

19
00:01:53.102 --> 00:01:58.305
Oliver ran toward a puddle.

20
00:01:58.306 --> 00:02:01.630
"No, Oliver!" said Emmy.

21
00:02:01.631 --> 00:02:08.653
"We need to look nice."

22
00:02:08.654 --> 00:02:12.256
"Mud!" said Oliver.

23
00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:16.999
He ran toward the big muddy area.

24
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:22.140
"We can't get dirty, Oliver!" said Harry.

25
00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:27.863
Now Mom was ready.

26
00:02:27.864 --> 00:02:30.964
"Where are the kids?" she asked.

27
00:02:30.965 --> 00:02:34.857
"Outside," said Dad.

28
00:02:34.858 --> 00:02:38.678
"Oh no!" said Mom.

29
00:02:38.679 --> 00:02:42.940
"The kids will get dirty!"

30
00:02:42.941 --> 00:02:53.162
Mom and Dad ran outside.

31
00:02:53.163 --> 00:02:56.378
But the kids were still clean!

32
00:02:56.379 --> 00:03:03.741
"Whew!" said Mom.

33
00:03:03.742 --> 00:03:08.035
The restaurant was very fancy.

34
00:03:08.036 --> 00:03:15.843
"Don't we all look nice?" asked Mom.

35
00:03:15.844 --> 00:03:22.419
"Oops," said Dad.

